# Cheat Sheet

## نمایش Help

```bash
gobuster --help
```

## Directory Enumeration

```bash
gobuster dir -u TARGET -w WORDLIST
```

## Directory + Extension

```bash
gobuster dir -u TARGET -w WORDLIST -x .php,.js
```

## Directory + Redirect

```bash
gobuster dir -u TARGET -w WORDLIST -r
```

## Subdomain Enumeration

```bash
gobuster dns -d DOMAIN -w WORDLIST
```

## Subdomain + IP

```bash
gobuster dns -d DOMAIN -w WORDLIST -i
```

## VHost Enumeration

```bash
gobuster vhost \
-u IP \
--domain DOMAIN \
-w WORDLIST \
--append-domain
```

## VHost + حذف False Positive

```bash
gobuster vhost \
-u IP \
--domain DOMAIN \
-w WORDLIST \
--append-domain \
--exclude-length 250-320
```

